# Bot1 casts Phyrexian Metamorph with a Mox Sapphire and three Islands, and has it enter as a copy of Bot2's Thicket
# Gorilla rather than as its own printed 0/0 — which would have died to CR 704.5f the moment it arrived. Two things are on
# offer, its own artifact and the opponent's creature, and neither is targeted (CR 608.2d). The copy is an artifact in
# addition to its other types (CR 707.9b), so Bot1's new Gorilla reads Artifact; Creature where Bot2's reads Creature.

